static atom that holds in init:
  in : (and (W:q a) (:ps a))
  status: 1
  out: (W:q a)
static atom that does not hold in init:
  in : (and (W:q a) (:ps b))
  status: 1
  out: FALSE
negated static atom that does not hold in init:
  in : (and (W:q a) (N::ps b))
  status: 1
  out: (W:q a)
ground equality:
  in : (and (W:q c) (:= a a) (N::= a b))
  status: 1
  out: (W:q c)
when with a statically true condition:
  in : (and (W:q a) (when (:ps a) (W:q b)))
  status: 1
  out: (and (W:q a) (W:q b))
when with a statically false condition:
  in : (and (W:q a) (when (:ps b) (W:q b)))
  status: 1
  out: (W:q a)
empty and is true:
  in : (and)
  status: 1
  out: TRUE
empty or is false:
  in : (or)
  status: 1
  out: FALSE
negated partially instantiated static atom, no match:
  in : (and (W:q a) (N::ps2 x0 a))
  status: 1
  out: (W:q a)
negated partially instantiated static atom, with a match:
  in : (and (W:q a) (N::ps2 x0 b))
  status: 0
  out: (and (W:q a) (N::ps2 x0 b))
flattening + instantiated static atom, with a match:
  in : (or (and (and (and)) (:ps a)) (W:p a))
  status: 1
  out: TRUE
